  MeshShadowMode: None
  ShadowColor: {x: 1.000000, y: 1.000000, z: 1.000000, w: 1.000000}
  ShadowDensity: 1.000000
  Text: |-
    Hand Attacher keeps an object on a hand joint as the hand moves. In this demo a box follows the tip of your right index finger.
    
    Raise your right hand in front of you to see it. The box hides when the hand isn't tracked.
